 "notes": "Virginia Tax accepts the paper R-1 only for one of the reasons at the top (most new businesses must register online); paper_reason ticks it. Filled for the sections a tea shop or store needs: business profile (I), responsible parties (II), corporation or pass-through income tax (III), employer withholding (IV) and retail sales and use tax (V-A). Dates print MM/DD/YYYY. Addresses print as the street, then 'City, ST ZIP'. Seasonal answers list the months open ('May, Jun, Jul, Aug'); 'All year' ticks none. The SSN boxes (item 2a and each responsible party's) are never printed; the signer writes them. The FEIN repeats at the top of every page. The 'if different' mailing addresses and contacts inside each tax section, the insurance, communications, litter, vending and agricultural sections are left blank. The signature and its date are left for the signer.",
